            <ArticleTitle>[Clinical effect of hotyuekkito (buzhongyiqitang) on symptoms due to renal ptosis and stress incontinence].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1841-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Eleven patients with lumbago due to renal ptosis, and 23 patients with stress incontinence were treated with Tsumura Hotyuekkito (Buzhongyiqitang), an old Chinese prescription, 7.5 g, three times a day. The subjective symptoms were improved in 9 cases (82%) of lumbago and 18 cases (78%) of stress incontinence. No side effects were observed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
